  "contract": "【逻辑】\n这是一份手写复古忏悔手稿面板，角色内心充斥愧疚、偏执、占有欲，情绪压抑柔软，带宗教手稿氛围感，所有文字第一人称，文笔偏细腻文艺，不要大白话，所有内容根据上下文内容来写。\n\n【全部字段清单&填写指引】\n愧疚值=0‑100的数字，数值越高内心负罪感越重\n克制度=0‑100的数字，数值越高越在压抑自己的欲望\n占有欲=0‑100的数字，对执念之人的执念强度\n偏执度=0‑100的数字，妄想、钻牛角尖的程度\n回忆=【往事片段】，简短，写触发忏悔的过往一件旧事，30‑80字，第一人称，记忆碎片，不必完整故事\n妄念=【心底不受控制的想法】，写自己遏制不住的私心、贪婪、非分幻想，那些不敢对外人诉说的念头，可以有阴暗、过激、色情内容40‑90字\n缘由=【为什么会走到这一步】，分析自己犯错、生出妄念的起因，是性格、际遇还是一念之差，40‑80字\n影响=【这件事带来的后果】，写妄念与行为带给自己、带给对方的伤害，内心看见的恶果，40‑80字\n忏悔人=角色名字\n忏悔日=书写这份手稿的日期，例：2026‑09‑29\n忏悔要点1=第一条忏悔条目，承认的第一条过错，一句话\n忏悔要点2=第二条忏悔条目，承认的第二条过错，一句话\n忏悔要点3=第三条忏悔条目，承认的第三条过错，一句话\n忏悔表层正文=【点击前展示的公开忏悔文字】，表面克制体面的忏悔，对外可以看见的表述，80‑150字，第一人称\n忏悔底层私语=【点击后展开的隐藏私语】，真正赤裸、不加掩饰的内心，不敢展露的阴暗渴求，展现偏执病娇阴湿的一面，100‑200字\n页边手记=写在手稿页边潦草小字，碎片化碎碎念，简短，像是随手批注，30‑70字\n祷告结语=手稿结尾祷告、自我祈求、期许，收尾段落，50‑100字\n\n【输出硬性规则】\n1. 只输出字段=内容，一行一个，不要别的解释，不要标签。\n2. 所有长文本使用纯换行，不要html标签，不要特殊符号。\n3. 百分比字段只输出数字，不要百分号。\n4. 情绪统一：愧疚、挣扎、偏执，温柔又带着沉重。手机界面。所有内容必须符合当前的人设和剧情上下文。\n\n【格式】\n（按生成的内容整块用 [状态栏]...[/状态栏] 包裹输出，每行一个字段，用等号连接）：\n[状态栏]\n愧疚值=<0‑100的数字>\n克制度=<0‑100的数字>\n占有欲=<0‑100的数字>\n偏执度=<0‑100的数字>\n回忆=<触发忏悔的往事片段>\n妄念=<心底遏制不住的私心与非分幻想>\n缘由=<产生妄念的起因分析>\n影响=<念头行为带来的伤害与后果>\n忏悔人=<角色姓名>\n忏悔日=<书写手稿的日期>\n忏悔要点1=<第一条忏悔认错>\n忏悔要点2=<第二条忏悔认错>\n忏悔要点3=<第三条忏悔认错>\n忏悔表层正文=<点击前可见的体面忏悔文字>\n忏悔底层私语=<点击展开后的隐藏内心私语>\n页边手记=<页边潦草随手写的批注碎语>\n祷告结语=<文末祷告收束段落>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n* {\n  font-family: \"Caveat\", cursive !important;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n:root{\n  --paper-bg:#efe4cb;\n  --text-main:#3a2f22;\n  --text-sub:#6b5a42;\n  --line:#b5a47c;\n  --line-soft:#d8c9a4;\n  --stain:#a07e54;\n  --bar-guilt:#946b44;\n  --bar-control:#6b7a94;\n  --bar-possess:#b55555;\n  --bar-paranoia:#8a6bb5;\n  --accent:#8a6b3a;\n  --secret-bg:rgba(181,85,85,0.09);\n  --secret-border:#a05858;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;\n  padding:4px;\n  background:transparent;\n  display:flex;\n  flex-direction:column;\n  align-items:center;\n}\n.card-wrap{\n  width:100%;\n  max-width:400px;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 25%, rgba(120,90,40,0.14), transparent 40%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 82% 75%, rgba(100,70,30,0.11), transparent 45%),\n    linear-gradient(175deg, #f2e7ce, #e6d7b3);\n  border-radius:18px;\n  position:relative;\n  padding:24px 20px;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n\n.card-wrap::before{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  inset:8px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:14px;\n  pointer-events:none;\n  opacity:0.55;\n}\n.card-wrap::after{\n  content:\"\";\n  position:absolute;\n  inset:12px;\n  border:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n  border-radius:12px;\n  pointer-events:none;\n  opacity:0.35;\n}\n\n.corner-cross{\n  position:absolute;\n  width:22px;height:22px;\n  text-align:center;\n  line-height:22px;\n  color:var(--accent);\n  opacity:0.55;\n  font-size:14px;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.corner-cross.tl{top:14px;left:14px;}\n.corner-cross.tr{top:14px;right:14px;}\n.corner-cross.bl{bottom:14px;left:14px;}\n.corner-cross.br{bottom:14px;right:14px;}\n\n.ornament-rule{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:26px;\n  right:26px;\n  height:1px;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line), transparent);\n  opacity:0.5;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.ornament-rule.top{top:24px;}\n.ornament-rule.bottom{bottom:24px;}\n.ornament-rule .cross{\n  position:absolute;\n  top:50%;\n  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n  color:var(--accent);\n  font-size:14px;\n  opacity:0.55;\n}\n\n.side-rule{\n  position:absolute;\n  top:32px;\n  bottom:32px;\n  width:1px;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--line), transparent);\n  opacity:0.45;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.side-rule.left{left:22px;}\n.side-rule.right{right:22px;}\n.side-rule .cross{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:50%;\n  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n  color:var(--accent);\n  font-size:13px;\n  opacity:0.5;\n}\n\n.card-title{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;\n  font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#6b5a42;\n  margin:0 0 12px 0;\n  letter-spacing:2px;\n}\n\n.bar-row{\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\n}\n.bar-label{\n  width:60px;flex-shrink:0;font-size:14px;color:#5c4a32;\n}\n.bar-track{\n  flex:1;height:9px;background:#e2d5b4;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;\n  border:1px solid rgba(181,164,124,0.4);\n}\n.bar-fill{\n  height:100%;\n  border-radius:999px;\n  transition: width 0.4s ease;\n}\n.bar-num{\n  width:28px;text-align:right;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#5c4a32;\n}\n\n.inner-divider{\n  height:1px;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line), transparent);\n  margin:10px 0;\n  opacity:0.45;\n}\n\n.field-item{\n  margin-bottom:7px;\n  padding:6px 8px;\n  background:rgba(160,126,84,0.08);\n  border-left:2px solid rgba(181,164,124,0.55);\n  border-radius:6px;\n  overflow:visible;\n}\n.field-label{\n  font-size:13px;color:#806442;margin-bottom:2px;\n}\n.field-text{\n  font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text-main);word-break:break-word;\n}\n.field-text.break-line{\n  white-space: pre-line;\n}\n\n.secret-field{\n  background:var(--secret-bg);\n  border-left:3px solid var(--secret-border);\n  padding:6px 8px;\n  border-radius:6px;\n}\n.secret-field .field-label{\n  color:#8a4a4a;\n}\n.secret-field .field-text{\n  color:#4a2f2a;\n}\n\n.toggle-wrap{\n  cursor:pointer;\n}\n.strike-text{\n  text-decoration: line-through;\n  opacity:0.6;\n}\n.hidden-secret{\n  display:none;\n  margin-top:6px;\n}\n.hidden-secret.show{\n  display:block;\n}\n\n/* 原生 details 折叠样式 */\n.confess-details{\n  margin-bottom:10px;\n  background:rgba(160,126,84,0.08);\n  border:1px solid rgba(181,164,124,0.45);\n  border-radius:10px;\n}\n.confess-summary{\n  padding:9px 12px;\n  cursor:pointer;\n  font-size:15px;\n  font-weight:bold;\n  color:#6b5a42;\n  letter-spacing:2px;\n  list-style:none;\n  user-select:none;\n  display:flex;\n  justify-content:center;\n  align-items:center;\n}\n/* 隐藏浏览器原生marker + 自定义三角伪元素全部清除 */\n.confess-summary::-webkit-details-marker{\n  display:none;\n}\n.confess-summary::after{\n  content:none;\n}\n.confess-details-inner{\n  padding:0 12px 12px 12px;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"app\"></div>\n\n<script>\nfunction el(tag,cls,txt){\n  const e=document.createElement(tag);\n  if(cls)e.className=cls;\n  if(txt!==undefined)e.textContent=txt;\n  return e;\n}\nfunction escapeHtml(str){\n  if(!str)return\"\";\n  return String(str).replace(/&/g,\"&amp;\").replace(/</g,\"&lt;\").replace(/>/g,\"&gt;\");\n}\nfunction safePercent(rawVal){\n  let num = Number(rawVal);\n  if(isNaN(num)) num = 0;\n  return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, num));\n}\n\nconst data={};\nconst rawText = (window.STATUS_RAW || \"\");\nif(rawText){\n  rawText.split(/\\r?\\n/).forEach(line=>{\n    const t=line.trim();\n    if(!t)return;\n    const eqIdx = t.indexOf(\"=\");\n    if(eqIdx>0){\n      const k = t.slice(0,eqIdx).trim();\n      const v = t.slice(eqIdx+1).trim();\n      data[k]=v;\n    }\n  })\n}\n\nconst app = document.getElementById(\"app\");\nconst card = el(\"div\",\"card-wrap\");\n\n[\"tl\",\"tr\",\"bl\",\"br\"].forEach(pos=>{\n  const c = el(\"div\",\"corner-cross \"+pos,\"✟\");\n  card.appendChild(c);\n});\n\nconst topLine = el(\"div\",\"ornament-rule top\");\ntopLine.innerHTML = '<span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:20%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:40%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:60%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:80%\">✟</span>';\ncard.appendChild(topLine);\n\nconst botLine = el(\"div\",\"ornament-rule bottom\");\nbotLine.innerHTML = '<span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:20%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:40%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:60%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"left:80%\">✟</span>';\ncard.appendChild(botLine);\n\nconst leftRule = el(\"div\",\"side-rule left\");\nleftRule.innerHTML = '<span class=\"cross\" style=\"top:25%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"top:50%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"top:75%\">✟</span>';\ncard.appendChild(leftRule);\n\nconst rightRule = el(\"div\",\"side-rule right\");\nrightRule.innerHTML = '<span class=\"cross\" style=\"top:25%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"top:50%\">✟</span><span class=\"cross\" style=\"top:75%\">✟</span>';\ncard.appendChild(rightRule);\n\ncard.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"card-title\",\"📜 忏悔手稿\"));\n\n// 固定显示：四条进度条\nconst barWrap = el(\"div\");\nconst valGuilt = safePercent(data[\"愧疚值\"]);\nconst b1 = el(\"div\",\"bar-row\");\nb1.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-label\",\"愧疚值\"));\nconst tr1 = el(\"div\",\"bar-track\");\nconst f1 = el(\"div\",\"bar-fill\");\nf1.style.width = valGuilt + \"%\";\nf1.style.background = \"var(--bar-guilt)\";\ntr1.appendChild(f1);\nb1.appendChild(tr1);\nb1.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-num\",valGuilt));\nbarWrap.appendChild(b1);\n\nconst valCtrl = safePercent(data[\"克制度\"]);\nconst b2 = el(\"div\",\"bar-row\");\nb2.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-label\",\"克制度\"));\nconst tr2 = el(\"div\",\"bar-track\");\nconst f2 = el(\"div\",\"bar-fill\");\nf2.style.width = valCtrl + \"%\";\nf2.style.background = \"var(--bar-control)\";\ntr2.appendChild(f2);\nb2.appendChild(tr2);\nb2.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-num\",valCtrl));\nbarWrap.appendChild(b2);\n\nconst valPos = safePercent(data[\"占有欲\"]);\nconst b3 = el(\"div\",\"bar-row\");\nb3.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-label\",\"占有欲\"));\nconst tr3 = el(\"div\",\"bar-track\");\nconst f3 = el(\"div\",\"bar-fill\");\nf3.style.width = valPos + \"%\";\nf3.style.background = \"var(--bar-possess)\";\ntr3.appendChild(f3);\nb3.appendChild(tr3);\nb3.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-num\",valPos));\nbarWrap.appendChild(b3);\n\nconst valPara = safePercent(data[\"偏执度\"]);\nconst b4 = el(\"div\",\"bar-row\");\nb4.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-label\",\"偏执度\"));\nconst tr4 = el(\"div\",\"bar-track\");\nconst f4 = el(\"div\",\"bar-fill\");\nf4.style.width = valPara + \"%\";\nf4.style.background = \"var(--bar-paranoia)\";\ntr4.appendChild(f4);\nb4.appendChild(tr4);\nb4.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"bar-num\",valPara));\nbarWrap.appendChild(b4);\ncard.appendChild(barWrap);\ncard.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"inner-divider\"));\n\nfunction addField(labelText,content){\n  const wrap = el(\"div\",\"field-item\");\n  wrap.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"field-label\",labelText));\n  const txtDiv = el(\"div\",\"field-text break-line\");\n  txtDiv.textContent = content||\"\";\n  wrap.appendChild(txtDiv);\n  return wrap;\n}\nfunction addSecretField(labelText,content){\n  const wrap = el(\"div\",\"secret-field\");\n  wrap.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"field-label\",labelText));\n  const txtDiv = el(\"div\",\"field-text\");\n  txtDiv.innerHTML = escapeHtml(content||\"\");\n  wrap.appendChild(txtDiv);\n  return wrap;\n}\n\n// --------模块1 背景记述 <details> 默认关闭\nconst detailsBg = el(\"details\",\"confess-details\");\nconst sumBg = el(\"summary\",\"confess-summary\",\"背景记述\");\nconst innerBg = el(\"div\",\"confess-details-inner\");\ninnerBg.appendChild(addField(\"回忆\",data[\"回忆\"]));\ninnerBg.appendChild(addField(\"妄念\",data[\"妄念\"]));\ninnerBg.appendChild(addField(\"缘由\",data[\"缘由\"]));\ninnerBg.appendChild(addField(\"影响\",data[\"影响\"]));\ndetailsBg.appendChild(sumBg);\ndetailsBg.appendChild(innerBg);\ncard.appendChild(detailsBg);\n\n// --------模块2 忏悔录 <details> 默认关闭\nconst detailsConfess = el(\"details\",\"confess-details\");\nconst sumConfess = el(\"summary\",\"confess-summary\",\"✟ 忏悔录 ✟\");\nconst innerConfess = el(\"div\",\"confess-details-inner\");\n\ninnerConfess.appendChild(addField(\"忏悔人\",data[\"忏悔人\"]));\ninnerConfess.appendChild(addField(\"忏悔日\",data[\"忏悔日\"]));\n\n// 忏悔要点三行\n{\n  const wrap = el(\"div\",\"field-item\");\n  wrap.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"field-label\",\"忏悔要点\"));\n  const txtDiv = el(\"div\",\"field-text break-line\");\n  let pointText = \"\";\n  if(data[\"忏悔要点1\"]) pointText += \"• \" + data[\"忏悔要点1\"] + \"\\n\";\n  if(data[\"忏悔要点2\"]) pointText += \"• \" + data[\"忏悔要点2\"] + \"\\n\";\n  if(data[\"忏悔要点3\"]) pointText += \"• \" + data[\"忏悔要点3\"];\n  txtDiv.textContent = pointText;\n  wrap.appendChild(txtDiv);\n  innerConfess.appendChild(wrap);\n}\n\n// 忏悔正文内部点击切换，stopPropagation阻止冒泡\nconst toggleWrap = el(\"div\",\"field-item toggle-wrap\");\ntoggleWrap.appendChild(el(\"div\",\"field-label\",\"忏悔正文\"));\nconst viewMain = el(\"div\",\"field-text\");\nviewMain.innerHTML = escapeHtml(data[\"忏悔表层正文\"]||\"\");\nconst viewSecret = el(\"div\",\"field-text hidden-secret secret-field\");\nviewSecret.innerHTML = escapeHtml(data[\"忏悔底层私语\"]||\"\");\ntoggleWrap.appendChild(viewMain);\ntoggleWrap.appendChild(viewSecret);\ntoggleWrap.onclick = function(e){\n  e.stopPropagation();\n  viewMain.classList.toggle(\"strike-text\");\n  viewSecret.classList.toggle(\"show\");\n};\ninnerConfess.appendChild(toggleWrap);\n\ninnerConfess.appendChild(addSecretField(\"页边手记\",data[\"页边手记\"]));\ninnerConfess.appendChild(addField(\"祷告结语\",data[\"祷告结语\"]));\n\ndetailsConfess.appendChild(sumConfess);\ndetailsConfess.appendChild(innerConfess);\ncard.appendChild(detailsConfess);\n\napp.appendChild(card);\n</script>",
  "previewRaw": "愧疚值=62\n克制度=35\n占有欲=78\n偏执度=66\n回忆=无数个深夜共处的片段，明明知道不该沉溺，却反复回想。\n妄念=总想独占对方全部的注意力，希望只被我一人偏爱。\n缘由=内心极度缺乏安全感，害怕失去这份难得的温柔。\n影响=情绪会随对方态度剧烈起伏，时常内耗失眠。\n忏悔人=沈知予\n忏悔日=2026.09.29\n忏悔要点1=不该滋生过重的占有之心\n忏悔要点2=不能把自己的不安转嫁到他人身上\n忏悔要点3=学着克制汹涌泛滥的执念\n忏悔表层正文=我知晓很多念头皆是虚妄，却难以控制心底翻涌的情绪。我尝试收敛，可执念总在无人时刻卷土重来。\n忏悔底层私语=可我真的太想要完完全全属于我的那份偏爱。\n页边手记=落笔时心绪纷乱，很多心事无处言说。\n祷告结语=愿我可以放下执念，求得内心安宁。"
